# =====================================================================
# Fictional people and records for "Northwind Analytics".
# Every name is invented. Identity is the personId, never the name.
# Sample cases: duplicate names (two Daniel Kims), a name change (Chloe),
# a leaver (Daniel Kim, redundancy), a rehire (Nina), a correction
# (Aisha's FTE), a vacancy (POS0009), a reorganisation (Data & AI moved),
# matrix reporting (dotted line), a promotion (Chloe), skill growth and
# loss, a renewed and an expiring credential.
# =====================================================================

